{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 475362647494889898,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Behind Upstream",
      "source_hash": 14551342481103757617,
      "context_hash": 15768782981540764257,
      "translation": "업스트림 지연",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:17.732670Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This handler checks if a PR is based on an *X* days old commit.",
      "source_hash": 7044481010338098123,
      "context_hash": 12816146171941207263,
      "translation": "이 핸들러는 PR이 *X*일 지난 커밋을 기반으로 하는지 확인합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:17.732670Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Context",
      "source_hash": 16963689554404632371,
      "context_hash": 5136697480261839712,
      "translation": "배경",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:17.732670Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When a PR's code is based on a very old commit from an upstream branch: It passes when tested locally, but fails when the PR is submitted for testing through CI.",
      "source_hash": 4828191540416759610,
      "context_hash": 12879555327953322169,
      "translation": "PR의 코드가 업스트림 브랜치의 매우 오래된 커밋을 기반으로 할 때: 로컬에서 테스트하면 통과하지만, PR을 CI를 통해 테스트에 제출하면 실패합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:17.732671Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This is because the CI applies the commit patches to the current upstream branch, which may have new test cases, so it won't pass.",
      "source_hash": 16014662655189599092,
      "context_hash": 2089643875025344062,
      "translation": "이는 CI가 현재 업스트림 브랜치에 커밋 패치를 적용하는데, 이 브랜치에 새로운 테스트 케이스가 있을 수 있어 통과하지 못하기 때문입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:17.732671Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "We need to rebase the PR to the nearest upstream branch.",
      "source_hash": 9404885831914989569,
      "context_hash": 5273501972356352952,
      "translation": "PR을 가장 가까운 업스트림 브랜치로 리베이스해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:17.732671Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Configuration",
      "source_hash": 4935613502183038470,
      "context_hash": 1799003799646400401,
      "translation": "설정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:17.732671Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The default threshold is currently set at **7 days**.",
      "source_hash": 1753584007274653747,
      "context_hash": 17389130740864881609,
      "translation": "현재 기본 임계값은 **7일**로 설정되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:17.732671Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This feature is enabled on a repository by having a `[behind-upstream]` table in `triagebot.toml`:",
      "source_hash": 5298819621855314279,
      "context_hash": 5397258096802356642,
      "translation": "이 기능은 저장소의 `triagebot.toml`에 `[behind-upstream]` 테이블을 두면 활성화됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:17.732671Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "or, you can set the day threshold,",
      "source_hash": 12650882589481246563,
      "context_hash": 9955010958102064387,
      "translation": "또는 일수 임계값을 직접 설정할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:17.732671Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Implementation",
      "source_hash": 14188291987651099077,
      "context_hash": 11706632491152952450,
      "translation": "구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:17.732671Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "See [`src/handlers/check_commits/behind_upstream.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/check_commits/behind_upstream.rs).",
      "source_hash": 6823350257493930985,
      "context_hash": 5801226501789644448,
      "translation": "[`src/handlers/check_commits/behind_upstream.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/check_commits/behind_upstream.rs)를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:17.732671Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}